A||||2||loafer87gt||Need For Speed 5 Rocks!!!||||10||
Z||000000||loafer87gt||04-19-2000||02:27 AM||||I just bought NFS5: Porsche Unleashed for my PC and Wow! This game is incredible! I always seemed to get bored with the the old Need For Speed games because of the repetitive tracks, but this game is much better because it uses long DETAILED tracks instead of doing several laps on the smaller courses. The other cool thing is that their are some city levels where you can dart down the back alleys, and several neat jumps and short cuts. I am so impressed with this game taht I just ordered a force feedback wheel and, pedals, and a six speed shifter to go with it for $180 bucks from Act Labs. Also, the graphics will make you drool! I also really like the way you can customize your cars, from adding bigger carbs, changing transmissions, shocks, springs, swaybars, rims, manifolds, etc.... much like in Gran Turismo. EA did a great job on this game. Anyways, I going back to finish hotrodding up my 356 Speedster, I just added in bigger carbs, a new tranny, and all the other go fast parts and got her up to 135 MPH! Later guys and gals,||||reg||10
Z||000001||ChadMan||04-19-2000||08:42 AM||||You're not kidding, loafer - Porsche Unleashed is fantastic.  That new 4-point physics model makes it so realistic.  It's really more of a racing simulation than a video game.<P>I have completed the Factory Driver mode and Evolution.  Isn't it funny how some of the slower cars are the most fun?  I love my 356 Carrera 2.0, my '67 911S and my 2000 Boxster S with lots of go-fast parts.  My favorite has to be the '78 "Moby Dick" Le Mans 935.<P>Did you see that they're coming out with Need For Speed: Motor City this fall?  It will play like Porsche Unleashed but offers a ton of muscle cars - Mopars, Vettes, Mustangs, GTOs, you name it!<P>It would never happen, but could you imagine playing Fiero Unleashed?  You start out in 1984 with 8000 bucks and buy a stripped Econo coupe, then move up to an Indy with the 4.10 4-speed, then the 85 GT...no, that's too much like my real life.||||reg||1
Z||000002||overlord||04-19-2000||08:02 PM||||i also have porsche unleashed...what a sweet game...so realisitic..grahphics and handling of the cars.<P>i cant wait for motor city...its supposed to be like real street racing....stop lights traffic signs, cops, traffic....swweeeeett..||||reg||1
